<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:1286e7ac-4948-4b92-8227-61d9d064283c">
              <SHORT-NAME>Cdd</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">The CDD module describes the minimal requirements that are necessary for the configuration of a CDD with respect to the surrounding standardized BSW modules.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：Cdd（Complex Device Driver）模块是用于访问复杂外设的通用驱动程序，CDD模块虽然是属于AUTOSAR的一部分，但是该模块没有被AUTOSAR标准化。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：Cdd需要遵循AUTOSAR的接口和模块规范来实现与AUTOSAR软件架构的兼容；在设计Cdd时，Cdd的开发和集成应遵循AUTOSAR的软件开发流程。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00016</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:6c020b3e-c61f-45e6-988c-8b1dd46692b8">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CddComStackContribution</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Contribution of COM Stack modules.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddComStackContribution配置项用于定义复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver, CDD）提供的服务和接口，以及它们与AUTOSAR通信栈的其他部分交互。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddComStackContribution时，需要确保CDD与通信栈其他模块的接口和服务定义清晰且一致；CDD应遵循AUTOSAR标准中定义的接口规范。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00017</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a85003e9-585f-44b6-b499-633eeaa58362">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddComIfUpperLayerContribution</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Parameters that are necessary for the configuration of a Complex Driver that serves as the UpperLayer of the Com Interface module.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddComIfUpperLayerContribution配置项用于定义复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver, CDD）与通信接口层（ComIf）之间的交互。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：CDD的实现必须保证数据的一致性和同步；此配置项的使用应当与系统架构和通信需求紧密相关，确保正确集成CDD的功能。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00018</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c94191ae-a883-4bb9-ac3e-841fc5f69c09">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddComIfUpperLayerRxPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container specifies Rx PDUs that are exchanged between the CDD and the standardized BSW module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddComIfUpperLayerRxPdu 用于定义从通信驱动到上层模块的接收PDU（协议数据单元）的映射关系，确保数据能够正确地从底层传输到应用层。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保PDU的ID和类型与系统中其他PDU的配置不冲突，应保持映射关系的一致性和准确性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00049</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cd9c5fb8-5f36-4b7a-8e90-ee6b8e7ba22c">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddComIfHandleId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">ECU wide unique, symbolic handle for the Pdu.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00051</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:4a9c0e26-9b38-48f8-8180-5dcee98e0fad">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddComIfPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the &quot;global&quot; Pdu structure to allow harmonization of handle IDs in the COM-Stack.</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00050</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucConfigSet/EcucPduCollection/Pdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:ef09dcb2-7fd7-49cc-a931-f39a4eecac1c">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddComIfUpperLayerTxPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container specifies Tx PDUs that are exchanged between the CDD and the standardized BSW module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddComIfUpperLayerTxPdu配置项用于定义复杂驱动设备（CDD）与通信接口层之间传输数据单元（PDU）的属性，包括PDU的标识符、大小和目标模块等信息。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保PDU标识符的唯一性，避免数据传输冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00019</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b807ad28-9b7a-4650-8414-360909b41c1e">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddComIfHandleId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">ECU wide unique, symbolic handle for the Pdu.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddComIfHandleId是用于标识Complex Device Driver (CDD)与Communication Interface之间通信的唯一标识符，确保数据传输的正确性。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：CddComIfHandleId的值需要在整个项目中保持唯一。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00021</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:5f78db18-cb6f-41b4-84a2-55d58da0cb0c">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddComIfPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the &quot;global&quot; Pdu structure to allow harmonization of handle IDs in the COM-Stack.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddComIfPduRef 是用于定义通信驱动设备（CDD）与PDU（协议数据单元）之间的接口引用，确保数据正确地在CDD和网络层之间传输。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保CddComIfPduRef正确映射到相应的PDU，以保证数据传输的准确性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00020</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucConfigSet/EcucPduCollection/Pdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:15f24c4f-fbb3-4669-80f3-9b197deb7c62">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddComMLowerLayerContribution</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Parameters that are necessary for the configuration of a Complex Driver that serves as the LowerLayer of the Communication Manager module.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddComMLowerLayerContribution配置项用于定义复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver, CDD）在通信管理（ComM）中的下层贡献，即CDD如何影响网络管理状态。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保CddComMLowerLayerContribution的配置与CDD的实际功能和网络管理需求相匹配；CDD需要根据网络状态正确地报告其状态给ComM模块；在配置时，应注意与其他网络管理参与者的交互和协调。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00030</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:56004dbf-51bf-4a1c-a027-483d08639255">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddComMLowerLayerChannel</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the network specific parameters.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddComMLowerLayerChannel配置项用于定义复杂驱动器（Complex Device Driver, CDD）与底层通信接口之间的通道，确保CDD能够通过指定的通道与底层硬件或通信栈进行数据交换。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddComMLowerLayerChannel时，需要确保所指定的通道与CDD的功能和底层硬件接口相匹配；此配置项应与系统的通信需求和架构设计保持一致；在多通道系统中，正确的通道分配对于系统性能和可靠性至关重要。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00031</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:5351dd2e-6f89-4c5c-9fc8-4a301d7cdac9">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddComMLowerLayerChannelRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Unique handle to identify one certain network. Reference to one of the network handles configured for the ComM.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddComMLowerLayerChannelRef 是用于指定通信驱动层（CDD）与底层通信通道之间的关联，确保数据能够正确地在不同层之间传输。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的通道与CDD兼容；该配置项对系统的通信稳定性和效率有直接影响；在多通道系统中，正确的通道引用尤为关键。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d97e1043-dd9e-4703-a719-607ce792be19">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddGenericNmLowerLayerContribution</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Parameters that are necessary for the configuration of a Complex Driver that serves as the LowerLayer of the Generic NM module.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGenericNmLowerLayerContribution配置项用于定义通用诊断网络管理（Generic Diagnostic Network Management, GenericNm）组件与下层网络管理模块之间的接口贡献，这影响了GenericNm组件的行为和网络管理消息的处理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保与下层网络管理协议的兼容性和正确的接口映射；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能有具体的接口和行为规范，需要遵循这些规范来配置；如果项目中没有使用GenericNm组件，则此配置项不适用。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00033</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:119abe0c-226e-4251-abb0-d59123945082">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddGenericNmLowerLayerChannel</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">NM Channel specific configuration parameters.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGenericNmLowerLayerChannel配置项用于定义通用诊断网络管理（Generic Network Management, GenericNm）模块与下层通信通道（如CAN, LIN等）之间的关联。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保该通道已在网络管理配置中定义；该配置项必须与实际的物理通道设置相匹配，以保证网络管理的正确性；在多通道系统中，每个GenericNm实例应正确映射到对应的物理通道。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00034</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:f5240286-e1ac-4c12-9f47-0c23e033cf85">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddGenericNmComMNetworkHandleRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This reference points to the unique channel defined by the ComMChannel and provides access to the unique channel index value in ComMChannelId.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGenericNmComMNetworkHandleRef是一个配置项，用于指定通用诊断网络管理（Generic Network Management，简称GenericNm）与通信管理模块（Communication Manager，简称ComM）之间的网络句柄引用，确保网络管理和通信管理之间的正确关联。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的网络句柄与实际使用的网络句柄相匹配，避免因句柄不匹配导致的通信问题；该配置项对于实现网络管理策略至关重要，应仔细配置以确保网络的正确管理和控制；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保使用正确的数据类型和格式符合规范要求。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00035</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:71d42766-e8d1-477c-854e-5116606f8919">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddJ1939RmContribution</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Contribution of J1939Rm module</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddJ1939RmContribution 配置项用于定义特定通信驱动（CDD）在J1939网络管理中的角色和行为，确保网络管理的正确实施和通信的有效性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：此配置项必须与网络管理策略和其他网络参与者的配置兼容；确保配置正确反映了CDD的功能和责任；在实施此配置时，应详细测试网络的稳定性和通信的可靠性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00079</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:4a9f8044-b6d2-4387-96bf-6e80fc44de6b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddJ1939RmAckIndication</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether the &lt;User&gt;_AckIndication callback function is implemented.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddJ1939RmAckIndication配置项用于定义一个回调函数，该函数在接收到J1939网络上的ACK（确认）消息时被调用，用于处理确认消息的接收。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置项时，需要确保已经在系统中实现了J1939通信协议栈，并且正确配置了相关的网络管理参数；此配置项需要与具体的应用层协议处理逻辑紧密结合，以确保正确解析和响应ACK消息；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于网络管理和通信服务的配置和实现有详细规范，需要遵循这些规范以保证系统的兼容性和可靠性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00081</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
