                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d4920631-85b0-4376-8743-3babb19cdc29">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddPduRLowerLayerContribution</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Parameters that are necessary for the configuration of a Complex Driver that serves as the LowerLayer of the Pdu Router module.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddPduRLowerLayerContribution配置项定义了复杂驱动（CDD）作为下层通信模块与PduR模块交互。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保CDD与底层通信协议栈之间的接口匹配正确。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00022</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
