                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container specifies Rx PDUs that are exchanged between the CDD and the standardized BSW module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddPduRLowerLayerRxPdu是一个配置项，用于定义复杂驱动器（Complex Device Driver, CDD）接收的PDU（协议数据单元）与底层通信接口之间的映射关系。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddPduRLowerLayerRxPdu时，需要确保PDU与底层通信层的兼容性和正确的映射关系。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00046</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
