                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:186d1878-40b0-4a5a-aae4-8ba77dd3ce93">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddPduRLowerLayerTxPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container specifies Tx PDUs that are exchanged between the CDD and the standardized BSW module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddPduRLowerLayerTxPdu配置项用于定义从复杂设备驱动（CDD）到底层传输层的发送PDU（协议数据单元）的映射关系，确保数据能够正确地从应用层传输到物理层。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保PDU的唯一性和正确的映射关系，避免数据传输错误。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00023</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
