                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:e95cede4-9ee6-493d-9905-de3c13f222ec">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddPduRLowerLayerHandleId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">ECU wide unique, symbolic handle for the Pdu.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddPduRLowerLayerHandleId用于标识Complex Device Driver (CDD)中PDU Router (PduR)向下层通信接口（如CAN, LIN等）发送或接收PDU时使用的唯一标识符。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该标识符必须在系统中唯一，以确保PDU的正确路由；配置时需确保与底层通信接口的配置相匹配。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00025</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
