                          <SHORT-NAME>CddPduRUpperLayerTxPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container specifies Tx PDUs that are exchanged between the CDD and the standardized BSW module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddPduRUpperLayerTxPdu配置项用于定义复杂驱动器（Complex Device Driver, CDD）发送的PDU（协议数据单元）与PDU路由器（PduR）之间的映射关系，确保数据能够正确地从CDD传输到上层协议栈。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddPduRUpperLayerTxPdu时，需要确保PDU的标识符与系统中其他PDU的标识符不冲突；此外，应当注意PDU的大小和格式要符合上层协议的要求；最后，确保映射关系的一致性，以便PduR能够正确地处理来自CDD的数据。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00027</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:494839ff-3064-902e-195e-6a080c01ed16">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddPduRApiType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter configures the type of the CDD interface (IF/TP)</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00052</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:667cd56e-b4ae-d27d-d790-65aefe43fc8b">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>IF</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:b9341287-4124-d627-a24d-5b01c89cc725">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TP</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ba3c213c-e704-46a1-a0e5-a59e7a501d50">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddPduRUpperLayerHandleId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">ECU wide unique, symbolic handle for the Pdu.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddPduRUpperLayerHandleId是用于标识复杂驱动设备（CDD）与PDU路由器（PduR）之间通信的上层处理标识符，确保数据能够正确地在CDD和PduR之间传输。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该标识符必须在系统中唯一，以避免数据传输的混淆。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00029</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:245c3911-45a2-40e6-aae4-29b332894893">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddPduRUpperLayerPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the &quot;global&quot; Pdu structure to allow harmonization of handle IDs in the COM-Stack.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddPduRUpperLayerPduRef 配置项用于定义复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver, CDD）与PDU路由器（PduR）之间的上层PDU引用，确保数据能够在CDD和PDU路由器之间正确传输。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddPduRUpperLayerPduRef时，需要确保引用的上层PDU与CDD的接口匹配；此配置项应与系统中的通信矩阵和PDU路由策略保持一致。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00028</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucConfigSet/EcucPduCollection/Pdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:56b8bb27-e9b2-46b1-a7b1-4757fd76330a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddSoAdUpperLayerContribution</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Parameters that are necessary for the configuration of a Complex Driver that serves as the UpperLayer of the SoAd module.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddSoAdUpperLayerContribution配置项用于定义复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver, CDD）作为上层模块与SoAd模块交互。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddSoAdUpperLayerContribution时，需要确保CDD与SoAd模块之间的接口和数据流向正确定义，以保证网络通信的正确性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00060</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:da1be0d7-a4a4-49b4-869b-ed503497f5b8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddSoAdUpperLayerRxPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container specifies Rx PDUs that are exchanged between the CDD and the standardized BSW module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddSoAdUpperLayerRxPdu配置项用于定义复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver, CDD）与Socket Adaptor（SoAd）模块之间接收路径的参数，这包括PDU的标识符、长度和连接到的上层协议。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddSoAdUpperLayerRxPdu时，需要确保PDU标识符的唯一性，以避免数据传输中的冲突；PDU长度应与实际数据包大小相匹配。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00062</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7e42f612-7a4b-8e78-1092-b708a995ba2b">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddPduRApiType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter configures the type of the CDD interface (IF/TP)</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00052</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
