                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:64294f93-b185-4df9-839e-2cb2465619ea">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddSoAdUpperLayerTxPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container specifies Tx PDUs that are exchanged between the CDD and the standardized BSW module.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddSoAdUpperLayerTxPdu配置项用于定义复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver, CDD）与Socket Adaptor（SoAd）模块之间的上行传输协议数据单元（PDU），即CDD发送数据时使用的PDU。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddSoAdUpperLayerTxPdu时，需要确保PDU的标识与系统中其他PDU的标识符不冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00061</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:085064ce-872c-92bd-0d94-f66abb53de5d">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddPduRApiType</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This parameter configures the type of the CDD interface (IF/TP)</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddPduRApiType配置项用于定义Complex Device Driver (CDD)与PDU Router之间通信时使用的API类型，分为Tp和If类型。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：API的类型必须保持一致。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00052</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:2585003e-0b76-d50c-cbc6-f211ad95edd2">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>IF</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:783c3d56-97ec-d8b6-9683-e76477eeb86c">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>TP</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c291053d-7ea3-4bf8-a6bb-cd645bc71166">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddSoAdUpperLayerHandleId</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">ECU wide unique, symbolic handle for the Pdu.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddSoAdUpperLayerHandleId是用于标识Complex Device Driver (CDD)与Socket Adaptor (SoAd)之间通信的上层协议处理模块的唯一标识符。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个CDD与SoAd之间的通信通道的CddSoAdUpperLayerHandleId是唯一的。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00064</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>65535</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:0722bf06-30f1-43fa-853e-bfe084d3ef20">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddSoAdUpperLayerPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the &quot;global&quot; Pdu structure to allow harmonization of handle IDs in the COM-Stack.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddSoAdUpperLayerPduRef 是一个配置参数，用于将Complex Device Driver (CDD)中处理的PDU与Socket Adaptor (SoAd)层的上层PDU关联起来，确保数据正确地在CDD和SoAd之间传输。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddSoAdUpperLayerPduRef时，必须确保引用的PDU与CDD所处理的PDU匹配。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00063</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucConfigSet/EcucPduCollection/Pdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:5ddb5cdf-4b83-4980-b535-5aa4c700316f">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CddEcucPartitionInteraction</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This optional container holds the partition interaction configuration.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddEcucPartitionInteraction配置项定义了复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver, CDD）与ECU配置单元（ECUC）分区间的交互方式，这涉及到CDD如何与AUTOSAR软件架构中的其他部分进行通信和数据交换。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddEcucPartitionInteraction时，需要确保CDD与ECU分区间的交互符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4的通信机制要求；此配置项的设置应与系统的安全和隔离级别要求相匹配；在多核或多分区系统中，还需考虑跨分区或跨核心的交互策略。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00038</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:b329985d-d398-4f17-93cd-f29503da4d52">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddPartitionStoppedFunctionName</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Function name to be called when the partition which is triggering the Complex Driver is stopped.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddPartitionStoppedFunctionName 配置项指定了在分区停止时调用的复杂驱动设备（CDD）的函数名称。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保指定的函数符合实际的CDD实现并且已经定义；函数应当能够处理分区停止时的资源释放和状态保存；在配置时需遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4的命名和实现规范。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00040</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                      </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                    </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:46cceb2a-0c28-49ac-8bad-7558446a366c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddEcucPartitionRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the &quot;EcucPartition&quot; which executes the software which triggers the CDD.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddEcucPartitionRef配置项用于指定复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver，CDD）所属的ECU配置分区引用，确保CDD与特定的ECU分区关联，以便于管理和配置。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在多核或多分区系统中，正确配置CddEcucPartitionRef至关重要，以确保CDD运行在正确的ECU分区上；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中可能受限于特定的模块或组件支持情况；用户需确保分区配置与系统架构设计一致，避免资源冲突或访问违规。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00039</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EcuC/EcucPartitionCollection/EcucPartition</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:164437b6-d5da-479e-8a44-2f35a377e60d">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CddGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Contains the general configuration parameters of the module.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGeneral是一个配置容器，它包含了用于Complex Device Driver (CDD)的通用配置参数，这些参数用于定义CDD的基本属性和行为。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，CddGeneral的配置应当与CDD模块的实现和集成需求相匹配；确保CddGeneral的参数设置不会与其他BSW模块的配置发生冲突；在配置CDD时，应遵循AUTOSAR的模块化和接口标准，以确保模块间的兼容性和系统的可维护性。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00083</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:569d0642-5f70-4f5f-aa77-272df0a4e010">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddInstanceId</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the InstanceId of this module instance. If only one instance is present it shall have the Id 0.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddInstanceId 是一个配置项，用于为复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver，简称CDD）实例分配一个唯一的标识符，以便在AUTOSAR软件架构中进行区分和管理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddInstanceId时，必须确保在整个AUTOSAR项目中该标识符的唯一性；该标识符通常由系统集成者分配，以确保与其他软件组件的标识符不冲突；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，CddInstanceId的配置应符合标准规定的数据类型和取值范围。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00084</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>255</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a03e5ebe-16e2-4b9f-affc-84c3c21c0ab6">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeContribution</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Contribution of Global Time modules.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeContribution配置项用于定义复杂设备驱动（Complex Device Driver, CDD）对全局时间同步机制的贡献，即指定CDD是否提供时间信息以支持系统的时间同步。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddGlobalTimeContribution时，需要确保CDD能够提供准确和可靠的时间信息；此配置项通常与全局时间同步服务（Global Time Synchronization Services）相关联，因此需要与其他时间同步相关的配置项协同工作；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果系统不使用全局时间同步服务，该配置项可能不适用或需要特别注意其默认值和行为。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00068</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f12facf9-5a1e-44aa-a986-a384933b2810">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeDomain</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This represents the existence of a CDD global time domain. The CddGlobalTimeContribution can administrate several global time domains at the same time that in itself form a hierarchy of domains and sub-domains.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeDomain配置项用于定义通用诊断组件（CDD）所使用的全局时间域，确保时间敏感的诊断服务能够在正确的时间域内执行。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddGlobalTimeDomain时，需要确保所选时间域与系统中其他组件的时间域一致，以避免时间同步问题；此配置项对于实现时间同步的诊断服务尤为重要；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中并未明确定义此配置项，因此具体实现可能会依赖于供应商的实现。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00069</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:89cc02ac-ba99-4f80-acb9-b790496d5dee">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeDomainId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The global time domain ID.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeDomainId是用于标识Complex Device Driver（CDD）所属的全局时间域的唯一标识符，确保CDD在正确的时间域中执行其操作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddGlobalTimeDomainId时，必须确保其与系统中定义的时间域ID匹配；不同的CDD如果操作在相同的时间域中，应该使用相同的时间域ID；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对时间域的概念和管理有明确规定，需要遵守这些规定以保证系统的时间一致性和准确性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00071</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>31</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:cf98036b-5528-4e36-b4be-e681f06d7014">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddSynSynchronizedTimeBaseRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Mandatory reference to the required synchronized time-base.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddSynSynchronizedTimeBaseRef 是一个配置参数，用于引用一个同步的时间基准，这通常是由通用诊断模块（CDD）提供的，以确保时间同步。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddSynSynchronizedTimeBaseRef时，需要确保引用的时间基准是有效的，并且与系统中其他模块的时间同步需求兼容；此外，该时间基准应当由一个可靠的时间源提供，以保证时间同步的准确性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，如果时间同步的概念在项目中不适用或未被使用，那么这个配置项可能不会出现。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00070</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/StbM/StbMSynchronizedTimeBase</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:207dad27-7e80-4298-864e-7e8635c35bfa">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeMaster</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the global time master. Each global time domain is required to have exactly one global time master. This master may or may not exist on the configured ECU.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeMaster配置项用于定义一个通信驱动模块（Complex Device Driver, CDD）作为全局时间的主控，负责管理和维护系统中的全局时间同步。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要确保系统中只有一个CddGlobalTimeMaster被指定，以避免时间同步冲突；在分布式系统中，选择CddGlobalTimeMaster时要考虑网络延迟和精确度要求；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中并未直接定义CddGlobalTimeMaster，此配置可能属于特定实现或扩展，需参考具体的供应商文档。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00072</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:aeae86cd-fb22-4f9e-a95e-97e515273faa">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeTxPeriod</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This represents configuration of the TX period. Unit: seconds</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeTxPeriod 配置项用于定义Complex Device Driver (CDD) 发送全局时间信息的周期，即CDD多久发送一次时间同步信息。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值应当与系统中时间同步的要求相匹配；在配置时需要考虑网络带宽和系统负载，以免造成不必要的网络拥塞；如果配置的周期与AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中推荐的时间同步周期不一致，需要确保系统中其他组件能够适应这一变化。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00074</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">Inf</MAX>
                              <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2d7be998-7691-4591-bd81-2de3f860e3c3">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeMasterPdu</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container encloses the configuration of the PDU that is supposed to contain the global time information.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeMasterPdu配置项用于定义Complex Device Driver (CDD) 模块作为全局时间主节点时发送的PDU（协议数据单元）。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddGlobalTimeMasterPdu时，需要确保PDU与CDD模块的时间同步功能兼容；此配置项通常与网络管理和时间同步相关的其他配置项紧密相关，因此需要仔细协调这些配置以确保系统的时间同步准确性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能有特定的属性和参数要求，需要根据标准文档进行准确配置。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Please note that the configuration of CddGlobalTimeMasterPdu is optional and shall only be used for Complex Drivers that are using Pdus for carrying timeSync information.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00075</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:ef0938aa-4a6a-41e9-8c19-d446fad40f5f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeMasterPduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This represents the reference to the Pdu taken to transmit the global time information. The global time master of a global time domain is the sender of this Pdu.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeMasterPduRef是一个配置项，用于指定Complex Device Driver (CDD) 作为全局时间主节点时所使用的PDU（协议数据单元）引用。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddGlobalTimeMasterPduRef时，需要确保引用的PDU与CDD的时间同步功能兼容；此配置项通常与时间同步相关的模块一起使用，如同步以太网通信；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保配置项符合PDU的定义和使用要求。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00076</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Cdd/CddComStackContribution/CddComIfUpperLayerContribution/CddComIfUpperLayerTxPdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:3974d793-5ab0-43e2-8b3f-bfb6c9e21d5c">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeSlave</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of a global time slave. Each global time domain is required to have at least one time slave. The configured ECU may or may not represent a time slave.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeSlave配置项用于定义通用设备驱动（Complex Device Driver，CDD）中的全局时间同步从设备的属性和行为，确保系统中的多个组件可以基于统一的时间基准进行同步操作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddGlobalTimeSlave时，需要确保系统中有一个明确的全局时间主设备（GlobalTimeMaster）配置，以便从设备能够同步到正确的时间基准；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能不直接提及，因为全局时间同步功能的实现细节可能依赖于具体的AUTOSAR BSW模块或CDD实现；在实现时，应考虑网络延迟和时钟偏差补偿机制，以提高时间同步的准确性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00073</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                            <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:7e457826-b8ef-461a-b737-e4f8702d4ac6">
                              <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeSlavePdu</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">This container encloses the configuration of the PDU that is supposed to contain the global time information.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeSlavePdu配置项用于定义通信数据诊断（CDD）模块中全局时间同步协议的从设备协议数据单元（PDU），它指定了用于时间同步的数据传输对象。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddGlobalTimeSlavePdu时，需要确保PDU的ID和大小符合网络通信要求；此配置项对于实现基于时间的服务和功能至关重要，因此需要精确配置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确列出此配置项，可能属于特定实现或扩展，因此在标准AUTOSAR环境中使用时应谨慎。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Please note that the configuration of CddGlobalTimeSlavePdu is optional and shall only be used for Complex Drivers that are using Pdus for carrying timeSync information.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00077</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <REFERENCES>
                                <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:0e7b9266-0768-4b0f-81ac-d4409246fd26">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>CddGlobalTimeSlavePduRef</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <DESC>
                                    <L-2 L="EN">This represents the reference to the Pdu taken to transmit the global time information. All the time slaves are supposed to receive the Pdu.</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CddGlobalTimeSlavePduRef是一个配置项，用于引用Complex Device Driver (CDD) 模块中用于同步全局时间的从节点PDU（协议数据单元）。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CddGlobalTimeSlavePduRef时，必须确保引用的PDU与CDD模块的全局时间同步功能相匹配；此配置项通常与全局时间同步服务相关联，因此需要在实现时间敏感网络时特别注意；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项与其他网络管理配置项协同工作，以保证网络时间同步的准确性。</L-2>
                                    <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                                  </DESC>
                                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Cdd_00078</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                                  <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                  <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                                  <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Cdd/CddComStackContribution/CddComIfUpperLayerContribution/CddComIfUpperLayerRxPdu</DESTINATION-REF>
                                </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                              </REFERENCES>
                            </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                          </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
              </CONTAINERS>
            </ECUC-MODULE-DEF>
          </ELEMENTS>
        </AR-PACKAGE>
        <AR-PACKAGE>
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDestinationUriDefSets</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF-SET>
              <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsUriDefSet</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESTINATION-URI-DEFS>
                <ECUC-DESTINATION-URI-DEF>
                  <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsInvocationHandler</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESTINATION-URI-POLICY>
                    <CONTAINERS>
                      <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:34a06182-a4e4-4f79-b61d-3c3d2785a14a">
                        <SHORT-NAME>RteRipsInvocationHandlerFnc</SHORT-NAME>
                        <DESC>
                          <L-2 L="EN">This container describes an invocation handler function implemented by an RTE Implementation Plug-In to handle the invocation of server runnables and triggered runnables via a transformer.</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="EN">Tags: atp.Status=draft</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">概述：RteRipsInvocationHandlerFnc是用于定义RTE与底层软件组件之间的调用关系处理函数，它允许RTE通过特定的函数调用来管理和控制底层组件的执行。</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项需要确保与底层组件的接口匹配，以保证调用的正确性和有效性；在多核或多任务环境下，需要考虑调用的同步和互斥机制，避免数据竞争；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中未明确列出，需根据实际项目需求和工具支持情况进行定义和使用。</L-2>
                          <L-2 L="ZH">该配置项未使用</L-2>
                        </DESC>
